---
title: "generateToken (Legion: API Integration Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive: POST /v1/integration/token
    q_receive --> q_validate: extract username, password
    q_validate --> q_auth: validate credentials format
    q_auth --> q_error: credentials invalid
    q_auth --> q_generate: credentials valid
    q_error --> [*]: return 401 unauthorized
    q_generate --> q_sign: generate JWT payload
    q_sign --> [*]: return JWT token

    note right of q_auth
        INV-001: credentials must match Legion-issued username/password
        INV-002: returned JWT must be used for all subsequent API calls
        INV-003: invalid credentials must not produce a token
    end note
